{"id":758,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"The winner of competitions between Salazzle is decided by which one has the most male Salandit with it."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Only female Salazzle exist. They emit a gas laden with pheromones to captivate male Salandit."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It punishes Salandit that couldn’t bring it food with a fierce slap of its flame-spewing palm."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"Salazzle lives deep in caves and forces the Salandit it has attracted with its pheromones to serve it."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Filled with pheromones, its poisonous gas can be diluted to use in the production of luscious perfumes."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"For some reason, only females have been found. It creates a reverse harem of male Salandit that it lives with."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Corrosion","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon can poison the target even if it's a Steel or Poison type."},{"name":"Oblivious","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon is oblivious, keeping it from being infatuated, falling for taunts, or being affected by Intimidate."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Dragon"],"genderRate":8,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Black","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":757,"name":"Salandit","condition":null,"children":[{"id":758,"name":"Salazzle","condition":"Lv. 33 (female)","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[0,680],[1,1],[1,10],[1,50],[1,52],[1,123],[1,139],[1,207],[1,227],[1,259],[1,282],[1,283],[15,305],[20,230],[25,417],[30,510],[37,474],[44,406],[51,53],[58,92]],"machine":[491,512,97,34,784,807,913,337,349,406,227,283,203,263,313,126,424,53,394,374,492,416,441,257,270,63,304,282,141,189,417,315,398,342,182,156,799,184,421,806,214,188,482,164,241,129,36,269,915,851,168,86,92,390,885,474,261],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-224","name":"Salazzle","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Illustration Rare","numb